      "writtenOn": "2020-10-28T22:36:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not obvious to me where the check for TBT entry done should go. That\u0027s answering a different question than \"are the cable and partner capable of entering USB4?\" It\u0027s a bit unintuitive that enter_usb_is_capable would return different values at different times for the same discovery results. I\u0027m not sure yet what would be the clearest way to handle this.\n\nIf the USB and TBT modules could be decoupled, that would be ideal.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 199,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 199,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "83a132e89938540af4d5c764dd634a208b6f137c",
